 "root_cause": "Normal SafeLoader builds a mapping by overwriting earlier duplicate keys. Skill frontmatter could declare conflicting name/description/platform/version fields, including alias/escaped keys and merge overrides, yet silently install one selected value.",
 "changes": [
  "Use a per-parse SafeLoader and inspect the resolved root mapping keys before constructing the metadata dictionary",
  "Reject duplicate string fields even with equal values, escaped/aliased names or merge collisions with invalid_skill/422",
  "Preserve unambiguous merges, scalar aliases, flow maps, folded descriptions and exact source/reference bytes",
  "Dispose loader state in finally and keep shared PyYAML constructors unchanged",
  "Keep package limits, ZIP/path validation, domain metadata validation and owned async parse/install/close behavior unchanged; add a narrow protocol for unannotated loader methods"
 ],
